### මේ file එක VS Code (REST Client extension) හෝ Rider/Visual Studio වල run කරන්න පුළුවන්.
### පිළිවෙළට: login → token copy → @token එකට paste → protected endpoints.

@host = http://localhost:5000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Login (admin) — token එකක් ගන්නවා
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Register — අලුත් user
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### 3. Get all products (login ඕන — token දාන්න)
GET {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get one product
GET {{host}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create product (validation test — Price=0 දැම්මොත් 400)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 45.50,
  "stock": 30
}

### 6. Update product
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 2000,
  "stock": 8
}

### 7. Delete product (Admin role විතරක් — User token එකෙන් → 403)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Validation fail demo (invalid data → 400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "",
  "price": -5,
  "stock": -10
}
